<Base title="Technology — Sekiya" description="Sekiya Technology builds useful, reliable technical instruments and products.">
  <header class="page-head shell"><p class="kicker">Technology</p><h1>Build only what the work earns.</h1><p class="page-sub">Sekiya Technology develops useful, reliable instruments and products — commercial or open source — without turning Research into product validation.</p></header>
  <section class="section shell"><div class="institute-grid"><div><h3>Porous, not a pipeline</h3><p>Research can suggest Technology work; engineering and operational constraints can suggest Research questions. Neither controls the other.</p></div><div><h3>Current boundary</h3><p>Technology candidates are not active projects. No product is presented here until its scope, ownership and evidence permit public disclosure.</p></div><div><h3>Experimental AI</h3><p>A possible apparatus for controlled experiments, not a general-purpose agent platform or a scientific programme.</p></div></div></section>
</Base>
